cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "RIG-I translocation simulator"
abstract: >-
  A one-dimensional simulation of RIG-I molecules translocating along dsRNA, pausing, and forming
  multi-molecule complexes, built to examine how pausing relates to filament formation
  (WT vs. Δ2CARD RIG-I).
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/skondo-gif/rigi-translocation-simulator"
keywords:
  - RIG-I
  - dsRNA
  - filament formation
  - HS-AFM
  - simulation
